        desc = "External monitor interrupt clear (performance counter overflow interrupts). Defined in the vendor header, never used by the driver; field layout unknown.

Vendor driver `arch/arm/mm/cache-hil2v200.c` / `cache-hil2v200.h` (REG_).L2_INTCLR_EXT_MON";

