    reg {
        name = "L2 region register";
        desc = "Region 0..4 configuration (address region attribute registers). Defined in the vendor header, never used by the driver; layout unknown.

Vendor driver `arch/arm/mm/cache-hil2v200.c` / `cache-hil2v200.h` (REG_L2_REGION0..4).";

