    reg {
        name = "L2 internal performance counter";
        desc = "Internal event counter 0..10 (DS 3.10.2: statistics on cache accesses, write-backs, misses and miss waits). Event assignment not documented.

Vendor driver `arch/arm/mm/cache-hil2v200.c` / `cache-hil2v200.h` (REG_L2_INT_COUNTER0..10). All 11 elements read 0xFFFFFFFF on hardware (2026-11-08, stock U-Boot prompt after a cold boot, L2 off).";

        field {
            name = "count";
            desc = "Counter value.";
            sw = rw;
            hw = r;
            reset = 0xFFFFFFFF;
        } count[31:0];
    } L2_INT_COUNTER[11] @ 0x600 += 0x4;

